'''Coal''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 3rd tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearence ==
Coal has a stone-like texture covering the entire blade, which also appears to consist of a gradient, starting at a a charcoal gray at the tip of the blade, and ending at a solid black on the handle. 

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Coal Gun (2021)|partner gun]] under the same name.

